parts.after:
Under the following specific and objective criteria, the Planning Board under the provisions of Unified Development Review, may divide a lot where the resulting lots do not meet the required lot dimensions as a special use permit.

(1) The lot to be subdivided was previously divided as more than one record lot;
(2) The resulting lot areas after subdivision are not less than 5,000 square feet.

